    "description": "<b>Want to play and learn chess for free? Chess Universe is the #1 place for learning and playing chess. Here you can enjoy free unlimited chess games online and offline. </b>\r\n\r\nPlay chess online with your friends or compete against leaderboard champions.  Learn chess free with the best tools. Develop tactics, strategy, memory, and logical thinking. \r\n\r\nWith our new chess app you can improve your skills from beginner to master. Analyze your matches and take your chess skills to the next level. Learn chess while solving chess puzzles designed by chess Grandmasters and chess trainers.  \r\n\r\n<b>MAIN FEATURES</b>:\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>PLAY UNLIMITED ONLINE CHESS GAMES</b>\r\nCompete against online players and try to get on your country leaderboard. Rank up and become a chess master.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>DIFFERENT GAME MODES</b>\r\nTry out different game modes: Blitz Chess, Bullet Chess, Rapid Chess or the new Easy mode, where you can think about each move for a maximum of 1 minute.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>DAILY CHALLENGES VS COMPUTER AI</b>\r\nNew computer opponents spawn every 24 hours. The higher your chess rating, the more difficult your opponents become. The keys you receive for your victory unlock great rewards with new chess boards, chess sets and more.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>PLAY CHESS WITH FRIENDS</b>\r\nInvite your friends to the chess game! Connect with friends and play social chess online with them.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>CHESS LESSONS FOR CHESS BEGINNERS</b>\r\n Learn chess basics, how pieces move, chess tactics, chess combinations and chess opening tricks. Improve your chess skills for free by solving chess puzzles in our themed chess towers. More than 1000 lessons designed by the best chess coaches are ready for you.\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>PLAY AGAINST COMPUTER AI</b>\r\nTest yourself against 9 computer AI difficulty levels. Select PLAY VS COMPUTER and than PRACTICE MATCH to start with level 1 computer. You can also play this computer game without time pressure. Simply set the time to \"NO TIME\".\r\n\r\nChess transcends language barriers with its myriad names:  xadrez, ajedrez, satran\u00e7, schach, \u0219ah, \u0161ah, scacchi, \u015fahmat, \u0161achy... Yet, regardless of the tongue, it stands as the epitome of strategic brilliance, universally hailed as the greatest game of strategy in existence.\r\n\r\nChess Universe stands out from other online chess games with its unique design and exciting gameplay. Unlock cool pieces, chess boards and earn rewards as you learn how to play chess. Our free online chess has some features that make chess easier for you: <b>Hints</b>, <b>Undo</b>, <b>Game Review</b>, <b>Game Replay</b> and <b>Game Analyze</b>.\r\n\r\nChess Universe is the place to play chess online with your friends and other players from all over the world. Now it's your move. Play chess for free!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2705 <b>VIP Membership Subscription:</b>\r\n\r\nYou can subscribe to the VIP membership to unlock all chessboards, chess sets, special effects,  all academy towers, emojis, unlimited hints and undo moves in Play Vs Computer and in Chess Academy, an exclusive VIP character set and a VIP pet. Additionally, the VIP membership removes all ads and provides you with 40 gems every active week.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>ABOUT CHESS UNIVERSE</b>\r\n\r\nThe Chess Universe app is built by chess Grandmasters and gaming experts with the idea of presenting the best of both worlds in a unique, gamified chess adventure.\r\n\r\nCheck the newest updates, announcements, and events on: <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FChessUniverseApp%2F&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0IVkSrHvPclfsd6Vq1c6N5\"> Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fchess_universe&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw1ty4LK8j-S_8h7ZSzcZAF5\"> X</a>",
